Subject: [PATCH] common: EDEN_NX2_THREAD_USAGE logs each named thread's CPU
 time every 10 s

Shows which thread a slow scene saturates (guest cores, GPU front or back, VulkanWorker; pools
summed by name) and how much the unnamed ones take, without a profiler.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HmEAGe4MCAJnHoeqq7Uysk
